  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 1611.05 Metal Construction",
  "priorExpiration": "2005-01-10",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 1611.05 Metal Construction. Indoor storage facilities constructed with metal shall have sides, bottoms, and covers or doors constructed of number 12 gauge metal and shall be lined inside with a non-sparking material. The edges of the metal covers shall overlap the sides by at least one inch.\n\nSource. #6054, eff 7-1-95, EXPIRED: 7-1-03\n\nNew. #8116, INTERIM, eff 7-14-04, EXPIRES: 1-10-05; ss by #8231, eff 12-20-04; ss by #10396, eff 8-15-13",
